{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Prison is a horror game where you are stuck in a loop in a house that seems to change at the whims of a sinister Warden out to make sure you can never get out.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David Echo wakes in a dimly lit bedroom, the only familiar place in a house that feels eerily distorted. Your goal? Find the keys to unlock the doors and escape this spectral prison. But beware, the house is filled with terrifying surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you've finally escaped? Think again. A sinister warden watches your every move, ready to capture you and send you to an even more terrifying dimension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warden's Wrath</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warden does not like you beating his games and will try to make every loop harder, trying to make you quit and stay in his prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/aaf8c27f69f388e37085fb2e15b2971e.poster.avif?t=1761537628\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/aaf8c27f69f388e37085fb2e15b2971e.webm?t=1761537628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260000/extras/aaf8c27f69f388e37085fb2e15b2971e.mp4?t=1761537628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever changing house</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you return, the house alters itself. Key positions change as the warden tries to keep you locked in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st